+  /*    the resolution and scaling independent parts of a TrueType font    */
+  /*    resource.                                                          */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Note>                                                                */
+  /*    The TT_Face structure is also used as a `parent class' for the     */
+  /*    OpenType-CFF class (T2_Face).                                      */
+  /*                                                                       */
